        <item>
            <title>3.5.3</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 02 Jul 2026 09:58:04 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/sj719045032/claude-statistics</link>
            <sparkle:version>3.5.3</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.5.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's New

- Fixed Codex.app active sessions in the notch so multiple active threads remain visible instead of collapsing into one or disappearing before hook events arrive.
- Updated the Codex provider plugin path and SDK metadata used by marketplace releases.
- Improved local and release build reliability on newer Xcode toolchains.

## 中文

- 修复 Codex.app 在 notch 活跃会话中只显示一个，或在 hook 事件到达前完全不显示的问题；多个活跃线程现在会按各自 session 保留。
- 更新 Codex provider 插件发布链路和 SDK 元数据，确保 marketplace 用户能拿到对应修复。
- 改善新版 Xcode 下本地与发布构建的稳定性。
]]></description>
